    "title": "🚨 Water main break closes Elm Street; expect low water pressure",
    "text": "7 hours ago 🚨 Water main break closes part of Elm Street in Montpelier\nAs of September 26, 2026 at 3:35 PM , there is a large water main break at the Elm & Spring Street intersection in Montpelier .\nRoad closure: Elm Street / Route 12 is closed between Spring Street and School Street . Detour: Drivers should use Main Street as the alternate route. Water service: Several customers in the area may have low water pressure or no water while repairs are underway. Boil water: It is not yet known if a boil water notice will be needed. Repairs: Montpelier Public Works is on scene making repairs. If you have questions or need to report an issue, call Montpelier Dispatch at 802-223-3445 .\nMore Info: Alert Center • WATER MAIN BREAK: Elm & Spring Stre...\nThis article includes content summarized and organized with AI tools, which can make mistakes. Learn more.",
